  "prefLabel": "Pol 102.06 Quorum of the Council",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 102.06 Quorum of the Council. A quorum shall consist of a majority of the members of the council, and as such, can operate with the same authority as the full council.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00; ss by #12986, eff 2-1-20",
